  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Beeswax.png|200px|left|Beeswax]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 48\n |price = 1 to 234\n |time = 45 min\n |source = {{Infoicon|HoneyE|bigger|link=Honey Extractor}}\n |xp = 28\n |base = 65\n |dia = 3\n |time3 = 38 min\n}}\n'''Beeswax''' is a [[Products|product]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 48.\n\nIt is exclusively used to make candles.\n\nLike all [[products]], it is stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Making beeswax'''===\n[[File:Honey Extractor.png|150px|left|Honey Extractor]]\nBeeswax is made in the [[Honey Extractor]].\n\nTo make beeswax, players need the following ingredient, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Honeycomb.png|75px|Honeycomb|link=Honeycomb]]\n|-\n|'''x3'''\n|}\nIt takes 45 minutes to make one can, and 38 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] extractor. Each can gives players 28 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Selling beeswax'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside Shop]]\n* Beeswax can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 2,340 {{Infoicon|coin}} for 10 tins.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make beeswax costs 204 {{Infoicon|coin}}.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Using beeswax'''===\nBeeswax is used to make the following [[products]]:\n\n{{Item Usage|Beeswax\n|Strawberry Candle|1|48\n|Raspberry Candle|1|52\n|Lemon Candle|1|72\n|Colorful Candles|1|84\n|Floral Candle|1|95\n}}\n----\n==='''Strategy tips'''===\n* [[Boat]] orders never ask for beeswax.\n----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Bienenwachs\n|es = Cera de abejas\n|fr = Cire d'Abeille\n|it = Cera d'api\n|nl = Bijenwas\n|no = Bivoks\n|ru = Пчелиный воск\n|zh = Beeswax\n}}\n[[pt-br:Cera de abelhas]]\n\n[[Category:Honey Extractor Products]]\n[[Category:Honeycomb Products]]",
